366
00:22:19,785 --> 00:22:21,466
Don't mind

367
00:22:21,506 --> 00:22:22,427
light light boy

368
00:22:22,467 --> 00:22:23,187
浮気しちゃうぞ

369
00:22:23,227 --> 00:22:24,108
Don't mind
light light boy

370
